  "worked_solution": "First, we distribute the $(-3)$ over each of the terms in parentheses.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}(3p+5q)\\cdot (-3)+9q & = \\\\ 3p\\cdot (-3)+5q\\cdot (-3)+9q & = \\\\ (-9p)+(-15q)+9q & = \\\\ -9p-15q+9q\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we collect like terms.\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-9p-15q+9q & = \\\\ -9p+(-15q+9q) & = \\\\ -9\\,p-6\\,q & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
